es S. Metcalf","x":"In 2020, we delivered over $110 million for structural cost savings exceeding our original targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/04/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2020 Q4","e":"cnr","d":"2021-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey S. Lee","x":"We're able to favorably impact manufacturing, operating costs and lower SG&A, consistently delivering on our cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/04/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q1","e":"cnr","d":"2021-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James S. Metcalf","x":"In response to this inflationary environment, we are continuing to take price actions across all of our businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q1","e":"cnr","d":"2021-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey S. Lee","x":"In response, we have raised prices across our portfolio, mitigating substantial impacts to our financial results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q1","e":"cnr","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James S. Metcalf","x":"During the quarter, we made advancements toward being a cost advantage manufacturer and achieved approximately $25 million of structural cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q1","e":"cnr","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James S. Metcalf","x":"We're on track to realize our cost savings target of $75 million to $80 million for 2021, strengthening our manufacturing footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q2","e":"cnr","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James S. Metcalf","x":"In response to this dynamic inflationary environment, we continue to take price actions across all of our businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q2","e":"cnr","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey S. Lee","x":"Strong market momentum within the residential and commercial end markets, positive pricing index, coupled unprecedented backlog support our revenue guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q2","e":"cnr","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey S. Lee","x":"We realized approximately $30 million of structural cost savings during the quarter, which helped to mitigate additional costs we incurred to serve our customers, such as expedited freight and overtime.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2021 Q2","e":"cnr","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey S. Lee","x":"We have a great track record on the Windows business on, when we make an acquisition on the synergies and cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/cornerstone-building-brands-inc-cnr-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CNR 2026 Q1","e":"cnr","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Brock","x":"Throughout our operations, we continue to focus on cost-saving measures during this market uncertainty, and we fully anticipate carrying this positive momentum throughout the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/core-natural-cnr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CNR 2026 Q1","e":"cnr","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidanc